  <item>
    <title>EP16.由OpenClaw联想到的圆月的学术AI生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b61776f8b8079bfa5eb0c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b61776f8b8079bfa5eb0c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 02:29:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近OpenClaw大火，我自己也开始每天养虾，搞Vibe Coding，把我自己给AI付的钱尽可能压榨剩余价值。而在我的朋友圈里，圆月应该能算上是对AI深度使用，并且使用方面和方式上都很独特的一个存在——搞人文学术。那么这一期， 我来采访一下圆月的AI学术生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 圆月都用过哪些AI产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> 智障的文心一言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> Deepseek确实火过一阵，惊为天人&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a> GPT登场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> Claude &amp; Grok</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> AI对圆月学术的帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 语言优化与Claude</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">23:53</a> GPT5.4到底幻觉是否严重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> Gemini并不听话，还讨价还价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> AI对学术工作流的颠覆&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">45:34</a> 不要轻易以为有任何事情是AI绝对替代不了的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3266">54:26</a> 要不要跟风 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/666e7235b6a8412729104585/luwi7rpFRRuBAVrahbqzxTwIiUuz.m4a" length="54081014" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgl-uShZ67WnFdtGzcLXAZHE_Lq_.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
