  <item>
    <title>EP11: 突然选择了一期无聊的问题和极限二选一</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6828289dfcbc2e206b58a88b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6828289dfcbc2e206b58a88b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 May 2025 06:30:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>4月圆月接近忙炸，一直在论文论文论文，程天冲也一直在跟AIGC作斗争。但是我俩都忙里偷闲去了一趟东京。进入5月不能在拖更了，但是又感觉最近一直在分享生活，所以就决定来一起无聊的问题和极限二选一。当然，这些问题都是在帖子上随便选出来的，没有那种非常可怕的问题，不过倒是可以通过这些问题来了解了解我俩是什么样的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 你更会思考 过去/当下/未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">08:59</a> 描述一个你认为很自由的画面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 学生时代最快乐的三件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 考过最低分数的学科，多少分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 推荐最近喜欢的歌</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eh4y1m7N9?buvid=ZA4473AEEDE449FA478AB2EF7E44E53DC149&amp;from_spmid=search.search-result.0.0&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=0Iv06pzUMLetfWhW4%2B4mgQ%3D%3D&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=F15DA1D7-C3E1-4835-88A6-EDB57B207113&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=united.player-video-detail.0.0&amp;timestamp=1747461530&amp;unique_k=mC1BPRk&amp;up_id=3493265795975607" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eh4y1m7N9?buvid=ZA4473AEEDE449FA478AB2EF7E44E53DC149&amp;from_spmid=search.search-result.0.0&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=0Iv06pzUMLetfWhW4%2B4mgQ%3D%3D&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=F15DA1D7-C3E1-4835-88A6-EDB57B207113&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=united.player-video-detail.0.0&amp;timestamp=1747461530&amp;unique_k=mC1BPRk&amp;up_id=3493265795975607"><span>More Than Words</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gT411j7i2?buvid=ZA4473AEEDE449FA478AB2EF7E44E53DC149&amp;from_spmid=search.search-result.0.0&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=0Iv06pzUMLetfWhW4%2B4mgQ%3D%3D&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=5A1ACCDE-E2A1-43DE-9D8B-273A60EF934D&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=united.player-video-detail.0.0&amp;timestamp=1747461604&amp;unique_k=yFsLMU4&amp;up_id=663265852" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gT411j7i2?buvid=ZA4473AEEDE449FA478AB2EF7E44E53DC149&amp;from_spmid=search.search-result.0.0&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=0Iv06pzUMLetfWhW4%2B4mgQ%3D%3D&amp;plat_id=116&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=5A1ACCDE-E2A1-43DE-9D8B-273A60EF934D&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=united.player-video-detail.0.0&amp;timestamp=1747461604&amp;unique_k=yFsLMU4&amp;up_id=663265852"><span>招摇</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="【【SEVENTEEN】音乐之神 (God of Music)  4K蓝光 特效中字 MV | 极致画质，青春洋溢】https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q84y197M5?vd_source=5993feb4e0e037f9a1dde50ee59fd099" data-url="【【SEVENTEEN】音乐之神 (God of Music)  4K蓝光 特效中字 MV | 极致画质，青春洋溢】https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q84y197M5?vd_source=5993feb4e0e037f9a1dde50ee59fd099"><span>God of Music</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 日出 or 日落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 夏天看星星 or 冬天堆雪人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2935">48:55</a> 乐观主义 or 悲观主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3312">55:12</a> 在最强大的国家担任领导者，权力极大 or 在遥远的小国担任领导者，影响有限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3612">60:12</a> 失去记忆 or 失去情绪&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
