  <item>
    <title>EP10: 来说书啦，以及我们的近况盘点（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d648400766616acd3e3077</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d648400766616acd3e3077</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Mar 2025 03:52:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在开播的时候就说好要找一期讲书，结果迟迟没有动静。还好，这一期终于来还债了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>书对我们俩来说都是不可缺少的，我是有读书目标，而圆月现在的工作几乎就是读书。在此立标，以后一定多更读书的内容！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的四本书是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《怪异与阴森》—— 马可·费舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《巴黎侍者》—— Edward Chisholm</span></p><span></span><p><span>《与达洛维夫人共度一天》—— 张秋子</span></p><span></span><p><span>《香港谈食录》—— 徐成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 《巴黎伦敦落魄记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 《与达洛维夫人共度一天》出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 没有人其实是能一直持续不变的沉浸在一种高强度的痛苦之中的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 最终还是要回归生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 《香港谈食录》出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 用文字描述食物的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 书中的餐厅历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 香港的各类中餐菜系介绍 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> 开始立标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 圆月可怕的lecture &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a> 泰妍在向圆月招手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> 程天冲不幸换组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3086">51:26</a> 挺过春天，夏天更好 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/666e7235b6a8412729104585/ljuetNx6jnHW4xrQU60q3lqbJWHf.m4a" length="51153378" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmOh5LvU3fJw5H8qvAf7Q464gNA4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP09: 来说书啦，以及我们的近况盘点（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d62d57e924d4525ae3c985</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d62d57e924d4525ae3c985</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Mar 2025 01:52:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在开播的时候就说好要找一期讲书，结果迟迟没有动静。还好，这一期终于来还债了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>书对我们俩来说都是不可缺少的，我是有读书目标，而圆月现在的工作几乎就是读书。在此立标，以后一定多更读书的内容！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的四本书是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《怪异与阴森》—— 马可·费舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《巴黎侍者》—— Edward Chisholm</span></p><span></span><p><span>《与达洛维夫人共度一天》—— 张秋子</span></p><span></span><p><span>《香港谈食录》—— 徐成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 《怪异与阴森》出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 什么是哥特小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a> 怪异与阴森是什么概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1439">23:59</a> 《巴黎侍者》出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 餐厅的三个战场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">38:57</a> 服务生的着装要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2958">49:18</a> 读书的目的之一：打破想象 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/666e7235b6a8412729104585/lnc65vWXE-k0c3W1_Q4Mf849X2Wh.m4a" length="49695723" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:09</itunes:duration>
