  <item>
    <title>EP.07: 2024年终音乐分享：程天冲和圆月的十佳歌单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67389ac4f373fe5d4dc802be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67389ac4f373fe5d4dc802be</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Nov 2024 13:44:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一次超长录制，超长剪辑，超长成稿的版本，来自于我们各自2024年的十佳单曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些歌曲大部分甚至不是发布于2024年，只是因为今年才听到，或者在今年又对这些歌曲有了新的理解，才入选了今年的年度榜单。喜欢一首歌的原因很多，可以简单到只是好听，可以复杂到有丰富的背景故事。年纪渐长很容易陷入歌慌，希望这份歌单能让你在年末再收获一些好歌~</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下一键直达每首歌在本集中的第一个出场片段，不过还是建议从头慢慢听哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 圆月今年最重要的KPI就是追K-POP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 圆月01： 《休止符》— </span><em><span>少女时代Oh！GG</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 程天冲01：</span><em><span>《Florida!!!》— Taylor Swift feat. Florence and the Machine</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 圆月02：</span><em><span>《genie》 — 少女时代</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 程天冲02：</span><em><span> 《The Alchemy》— Taylor Swift</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 圆月03：</span><em><span>《Girls never die》— &nbsp;Triple S</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 程天冲03：</span><em><span>《Love Again》— Carly Rae Jepsen</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">38:02</a> 圆月04： </span><em><span>《Run Away with Me》— Carly Rae Jepsen</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a> 程天冲04：</span><em><span>《Youtiful》— Stray Kids</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3079">51:19</a> 圆月&amp;程天冲05： </span><em><span>《Afterglow》— Leon of Athens &amp; Transviolet</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a> 圆月06：</span><em><span>《Find Our Way》— Clear Sky</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">62:03</a> 程天冲06：</span><em><span>《Us》— Gracie Abrams feat. Taylor Swift</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4321">72:01</a> 圆月07：</span><em><span>《此夜记侠名》— 剑三同人曲</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4653">77:33</a> 程天冲07：</span><em><span>《Good Luck, Babe!》— Chappell Roan</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5092">84:52</a> 圆月08：</span><em><span>《IYKYK》— XG</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5442">90:42</a> 程天冲08：</span><em><span>《好啦如果你现在说爱我我还是会爱你》— 吴秉宸</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5672">94:32</a> 圆月09：</span><em><span>《Whiplash》 — ASPEA</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6100">101:40</a> 程天冲09：</span><em><span>《Pretty Boy》— LÉON</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6357">105:57</a> 圆月10：</span><em><span>《Time Lapse》— 金泰妍</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6694">111:34</a> 程天冲10：</span><em><span>《Cruel Summer (Live from The Eras Tour) 》— Taylor Swift</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luEdNM0fgcoKbGNBWkRZyQec7TvH.m4a" length="118849264" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:02:21</itunes:duration>
