  <item>
    <title>EP.06: 杂谈#01：圆月的朋友，我们看的新电影与程天冲读的书</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6726e5dacbe0e69c8baaf91b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6726e5dacbe0e69c8baaf91b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Nov 2024 02:59:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期完完全全的杂谈，也是我们最开始录播客的初衷，所以我们打算把这个作为一个固定系列定期更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>圆月的朋友们最近发生了一些自己的故事，而我想说的是一部电影和一本书，这些就是我们最近的生活。So, Let’s go!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 圆月的学生大变活人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="452">07:32</a> 圆月的IE人转换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 好朋友家人生病带来的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 有想法就要努力去做，不要停在原地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 聊聊《你伤害了我》这部电影 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 无脑差劲却冲上排行榜的短评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 《100日环游世界》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">52:57</a> 决定保留最真实的对话氛围 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqCogfLcw_5EDR3FktGYMXvQs_hw.m4a" length="53616953" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgi6lTQIc3PAeMZpGijJsNqo0AhW.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
